        <p>Volunteers log donated food one-handed while carrying boxes. I built a barcode-scanning inventory system designed for that reality. Serving 40,000 people across six pantries. Funded by the Daffron Family Foundation.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="#" class="project-card glass glass-hover reveal">
        <h3>EmotionFlix</h3>
        <p class="project-stack">React, TypeScript, Node.js, PostgreSQL</p>
        <p>Movie recommendations don't account for how you feel. This system scans your face on-device, maps emotions to genres, and adapts over time. 69 tests. No data leaves the browser.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="#" class="project-card glass glass-hover reveal">
        <h3>ADV Collision Risk Prediction</h3>
