  <!-- ═══ ABOUT ═══ -->
  <section id="about" class="section" data-bg="about">
    <h2 class="section-title reveal">About</h2>

    <div class="about-content reveal">
      <div class="about-prose">
        <p>I grew up speaking Bengali at home, English at school, and enough Hindi to follow along when my parents switched mid-sentence. Three languages before I was ten. That does something to how you parse ambiguity. You learn early that the same idea wears different clothes depending on who's hearing it.</p>
        <p>I came to Ramapo for computer science and stayed because the scale let me do things. Co-founded the CS club and convinced Bjarne Stroustrup to come speak. Managed 17 RAs and a community of 200+ students. Led the math club. Competed in ICPC at the New York regional. The range isn't a resume filler. It's the reason I know how to talk to people who don't speak code.</p>
        <p>I want to be the kind of engineer who understands the system end to end: the data, the infrastructure, the interface, and the person on the other side of it. Not a specialist in one layer. Someone who can look at a problem from the user's chair and trace it all the way back to the query plan.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-side">
        <div class="about-detail">
          <h4>Education</h4>
          <p>BS Computer Science &amp; Data Science<br/>Minor in Mathematics<br/>Ramapo College, 3.84 GPA</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-detail">
          <h4>Also</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Canstruction, 1st place</li>
            <li>Student Employee of the Year</li>
            <li>Presidential Scholarship, 4 years</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="about-detail">
          <h4>Elsewhere</h4>
          <p>
            <a href="https://github.com/Prashant002-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a><br/>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/prashant210/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a><br/>
            <a href="https://letterboxd.com/_Prashant_/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Letterboxd</a>
          </p>
